{
 "name": "Test room 3 — drawing",
 "notes": "Milestone 3/4. Press the draw key (Q for Blue, . for Pink) while standing on the ground, then drag the mouse in EITHER view to draw a line: it is solid only to your partner, lasts 3 seconds and you stay frozen until it fades. Traps treat lines as solid walls, whoever drew them. Obstacles, in order: gap 1 (8 wide) - bridge it for each other; wall 1 (5 tall) with an ARROW WALL - the ramp you draw blocks the arrows; gap 2 (10 wide) under ceiling FIRE JETS, ending on COLLAPSING floor - cross on the beat and keep moving; stepping stones; wall 2 (8 tall) with a LOW LASER and a rolling BOULDER - the ramp shields you from the laser and deflects the boulder; the pit with wall FIRE JETS; then FALLING SPIKES and a full-height LASER that needs a drawn blocker. Flags are checkpoints. Max line length 12 tiles; 2 second cooldown. Tab switches which character you control when testing alone.",
 "hint": "Drawing + traps. Q (Blue) / period key (Pink), then drag the mouse to draw a line your partner can stand on (12 tiles of ink, 3 seconds, you're frozen until it fades). Traps treat your lines as solid, so a line can shield someone: arrows, fire, lasers, spikes and boulders are all stopped by it. Flags are checkpoints. Tab: control one character.",
